The suite uses `/api/graphql`; I’ll also support the requested `/graphql` path. The one passing check is `graphql.unauthenticated`: the existing auth gate already returns 401 before routing.

The checks require batching and `closeIssue` alongside the other mutations. For IDs and cursors, they assert opacity, stability, node round-tripping, and pagination behavior, but don’t prescribe byte encodings. I’ll use base64 `Type:id` IDs and base64 offset cursors, and route mutations through the existing REST dispatcher.
